<title>GERMANY: TABLE-German June producer prices up 0.1 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>TABLE-German June producer prices up 0.1 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES  June 97	May 97	June 96</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.1	  +0.2	   -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.4	  +1.1	   -0.8</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  104.7	 104.6	  103.3</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.1	  +0.1	   -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.3	  +1.0	   -1.0</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  104.2	 104.1	  102.9</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    -0.2	  +0.6	   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +2.2	  +2.4	   +1.2</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  110.5	 110.7	  108.1</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
